Want to Make Waves in Tech? GBT Solutions Is the Place to Be!
🐝

About us:
GBT Solutions is a Portuguese technology company founded in 2018, part of the HFA Group, which was established in 1995. With a focus on delivering cutting-edge solutions across various industries, we foster a diverse and inclusive work environment and take pride in our commitment to excellence and innovation.

Position:
Full Stack Developer (.NET / Angular);
Location:
Lisbon, Parque das Nações, Portugal | Hybrid 2x/week at the office;
Parking:
Available for cars and motorcycles;

About this role:

We are looking for a Full Stack Developer with strong .NET and Angular experience
to join an international technology project focused on building scalable, cloud-native applications.
The successful candidate will work across both backend and frontend development
, contributing to modern microservices architectures, high-performance APIs and responsive web applications, while taking ownership of solutions throughout the full software development lifecycle.

Main responsibilities:

Design and build scalable backend and frontend features
;
Develop cloud-native microservices
supporting global applications;
Build high-performance REST APIs and event-driven architectures
;
Take ownership of services end-to-end, including design, development, testing, deployment and monitoring
;
Contribute to software architecture decisions, engineering standards and best practices
;
Develop modern frontend applications using Angular 20+
;
Implement reactive UI/UX patterns using Angular Signals
;
Apply mobile-first development approaches
and BEM conventions
;
Work with and contribute to existing Design Systems
;
Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams in an Agile development environment
;
Investigate, troubleshoot and resolve complex production issues
;
Contribute to scalable software solutions following Domain-Driven Design (DDD)
and Clean Architecture principles
.

Requirements:

Must-have:

Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering
or equivalent professional experience;
3+ years of professional backend development experience
;
Strong experience with C# and .NET / ASP.NET Core
;
Solid knowledge of Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
and software design principles;
Experience designing and developing scalable APIs and distributed systems
;
Experience with microservices architectures
;
Experience working with cloud environments
, preferably Microsoft Azure;
Experience with containerized applications
, Kubernetes or similar technologies;
Experience with Angular
and modern Angular development patterns;
Understanding of modern software architecture principles such as Clean Architecture and Domain-Driven Design
;
Ability to take ownership of systems and deliver production-ready software
;
Strong analytical and problem-solving skills;
Comfortable working in international and English-speaking teams
;
English level C1/C2
;
Legal documentation allowing employment and travel, such as Portuguese/EU ID, Passport or valid Residence Permit
;

Nice-to-have:

Experience with Angular 20+
;
Experience implementing Angular Signals
and reactive UI patterns;
Previous experience working with a Design System
;
Knowledge of mobile-first development approaches
;
Experience using the BEM methodology/convention
;
Experience with Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)
;
Experience with Azure Container Apps (ACA)
;
Knowledge of Azure DevOps / CI/CD pipelines
;
Experience with event-driven architectures
;
Experience with Microsoft SQL Server
;
Familiarity with GitHub Copilot or AI-assisted software development tools
.

Equal opportunity:

GBT Solutions is an equal opportunity employer and values diversity. We do not discriminate based on age, ethnicity, sexual orientation, gender, disability, or any factor other than merit.

By responding to this opportunity, I confirm that the data I provide constitutes personal data and that I have been informed, through the Privacy Policy, about how it is processed and about my rights. GBT Solutions does not request special categories of personal data; should I include any such data, I do so voluntarily and expressly consent to its processing, and I may omit it.
GBT Solutions may retain my profile and present it to client companies for suitable opportunities, based on its legitimate interest. I may object to this at any time by contacting rgpd@gbtsolutions.pt.

